  "name": "PICES Scientific Report No. 22 (2002) - PICES Science : the First Ten Years and a Look to the Future / edited by R. Ian Perry, Patricia Livingston, and Alexander S. Bychkov",
  "description": "This report provides eight papers that were presented during the symposium. The symposium reviewed the history and major accomplishments of the PICES scientific committees. [ LC Call No. GC781 .P535 no.22. ISBN 0973149221 ]\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To report results from PICES symposium held on October 8, 2001 in Victoria, Canada.",
